> Every quarter we will be publishing the[ winning] and[ highly] commended[ Flash] Fiction entries in our Short Fiction section.
Please see below for further details on the[ awards], general[ criteria],[ judges], and the[ submission] link.
Following a conversation with Kit de Waal (interview with TSS here), we are[ happy] to announce that submission fees for the Flash Fiction 400 competition will be waived for any writers from[ marginal]ised and[ disadvantaged] communities, or anyone[ suffering] from economic hardship. For further details[ please] click here.
